# Nose Stall: straight up the vert ramp, I + left at the coping (the direction only as it catches, so
# it barely spins): the stall (lip review: ./skate strip --sheet scenarios/lips.strips), let go: drop
# back in fakie.
park lab
spawn lab_vert
cmd 6 speed 10
hold grind 212..278
hold left 212..214
bot balance
run 600
expect event lipStart{trick=Nose Stall} within 210..220
expect event lipEnd{trick=Nose Stall,reason=drop in} within 276..282
expect event land{fakie=true} within 280..380
expect no event bail
